  "result": "I've fixed both bugs. Type-checking passes and all 617 existing tests pass, but I didn't add new tests for these cases.\n\n1. **Removed members kept their seat.** The periodic recount counted every member row, including removed ones. It now counts only members who are active and not removed (`src/server/repositories/usage-repository.ts`). Removing a member now also triggers an immediate recount (`src/server/services/usage-service.ts`), so the seat frees up right away. I used a recount instead of subtracting one, so removing the same member twice can't free two seats.\n2. **Revoked invitations kept their seat.** The pending-invitation count only excluded accepted invitations. It now excludes revoked ones too (`src/server/repositories/invitation-repository.ts`). That fixes both revoking and re-sending in a full workspace, and a workspace that really is full is still refused.",
